5.005_62 Version 12 (1999-11-15)
  This is the first perl for EPOC build on Linux. It is built on the
  command line. I still have to find a good way to do it automatically.

  New Features: 
    IO extension is now compiled in. 
    The Header Getlopt/Long is now autosplitted by default.

  The patch file is a little bit out of date in respect to the README.epoc file.
